1
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:19,120
Friday, 30 May

2
00:00:20,096 --> 00:00:23,216
Today we went on a school trip to a farm !

3
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,632
It was tiring but great fun! In the morning,

4
00:00:27,776 --> 00:00:29,248
we explored the farm.

5
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:33,264
There were large tents with tomatoes, cucumbers,

6
00:00:33,424 --> 00:00:35,648
and many other fruits and vegetables.

7
00:00:36,128 --> 00:00:41,904
The farmer told us about how these fruits and vegetables go from the fields to our tables.

8
00:00:42,304 --> 00:00:43,712
I was very interested

9
00:00:43,808 --> 00:00:46,752
because I usually only see them in the supermarket.

10
00:00:47,536 --> 00:00:49,568
Then we got straight to work!

11
00:00:49,824 --> 00:00:52,592
First, we picked some strawberries.

12
00:00:52,848 --> 00:00:54,624
The work seemed easy,

13
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,928
but it took time to get it right.

14
00:00:57,312 --> 00:01:00,160
Slowly, we filled many baskets.

